      "url": "https://www.va.gov/pension/aid-attendance-housebound/",
      "phone": "800-827-1000",
      "steps": [
        "You must already get, or be eligible for, a VA pension (see us-va-veterans-pension).",
        "Have a medical examiner complete VA Form 21-2680 (Examination for Housebound Status or Permanent Need for Regular Aid and Attendance).",
        "Apply online, by mail to the Pension Intake Center (PO Box 5365, Janesville, WI), or in person at a VA regional office."
      ]
